Feature: Calculate monthly shipment statistics for clients

  Background:
    Given the table "purgo_playground.shipments" with columns "shipment_id", "shipment_date", "product_id", "client_id", "status", "cancellation_flag", "revenue"
    And the table "purgo_playground.clients" with columns "client_id", "client_name"

  Scenario Outline: Calculate monthly shipment statistics for a given client
    Given shipments data with <shipment_date>, <client_id>, and <cancellation_flag>
    When I extract the year and month from <shipment_date>
    Then I group the shipments data by <client_id>, year, and month
    And calculate the total shipments per client
    And calculate the cancelled shipments per client with cancellation_flag 'Yes'
    And join with client data on <client_id> to retrieve client_name
    And calculate the cancellation percentage as (cancelled_shipments/total_shipments) * 100
    Then display "client_name", year, month, total_shipments, cancelled_shipments, cancellation_percentage

  Examples:
    | shipment_date | client_id | cancellation_flag |
    | 2023-04-15    | 101       | Yes               |
    | 2023-04-20    | 102       | No                |
    | 2023-05-05    | 101       | Yes               |

  Scenario: Error scenario - No shipments available for a client
    Given shipments data with client_id that does not exist
    When I attempt to group the shipments data
    Then I expect an error message "No shipments available for the provided client_id"

  Scenario: Error scenario - Invalid shipment date format
    Given an invalid shipment_date format "15/04/2023"
    When I attempt to extract the year and month
    Then I expect an error message "Invalid date format for shipment_date"

  Scenario Outline: Validate cancellation flag for cancellation percentage calculation
    Given shipments data with <shipment_date>, <client_id>, and <cancellation_flag>
    When processing cancellation percentage
    Then verify cancellation_flag is either 'Yes' or 'No'
    Then ensure cancellation percentage is calculable only if cancellation_flag is 'Yes'
  
  Examples:
    | shipment_date | client_id | cancellation_flag |
    | 2023-01-10    | 103       | Yes               |
    | 2023-01-25    | 104       | No                |
